  "notes": "USAGE: {発売|はつばい} is used for releasing products for sale, especially new products, tickets, or media.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {発売|はつばい}する (to release, to put on sale)\n- {発売|はつばい}される (to be released)\n- {発売|はつばい}{中|ちゅう} (now on sale)\n- {発売|はつばい}{開始|かいし} (sales start)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {発売|はつばい}{日|び} (release date)\n- {発売|はつばい}{元|もと} (publisher, distributor)\n- {新|しん}{発売|はつばい} (newly released)\n- {先行|せんこう}{発売|はつばい} (advance sale)\n- {発売|はつばい}{記念|きねん} (release commemoration)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {販売|はんばい} - sales (ongoing selling)\n- {発行|はっこう} - publication, issuance",
